    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Set off on an exciting journey in search of new lands and untold treasures in a new time management game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560970/extras/2492f5df954cfb8eb4cd151114ff9337.avif?t=1724433762\" /></div><br><br>The main characters, young Captain Jack and his wife, Mary, embark on a journey to discover new lands and wind up on a tropical island in the middle of the ocean. Now they have to settle on it and build their own town. But doing so isn't as easy as it seems because the island conceals a multitude of mysteries and secrets. Exotic plants, ancient temples, and surprising inhabitants are waiting for you! <br>There's also sea, sun, and lots of fun!<br><br>During your journey, you'll discover new territories, explore caves, and meet charismatic characters. Construct and improve buildings, create a sawmill, farm, mine, and collect resources. You choose what to build: a hut, house, or hotel.<br><br>Build your own paradise on a tropical island!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The game features:</strong></h2>\u2714 Conquer 60 fun and challenging levels.<br>\u2714 Choose between Expert, Normal and Relaxed modes.<br>\u2714 Never get lost with the integrated Strategy Guide.<br>\u2714 Follow the captivating story and meet the locals.<br>\u2714 Upgrade and improve your town, build homes and hotels for settlers.<br>\u2714 Find all the hidden pieces and complete the puzzle.<br>\u2714 Open chests and look for pirate treasure.<br>\u2714 Explore the island and discover new territories.<br>\u2714 Craft, grow, harvest, and solve puzzles.<br>\u2714 A casual time-management strategy game suitable for the whole family.",
